    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26d2aba71a132a98",
      "translationZh": "使用适用于 Microsoft Excel 的 Grok 加载项，以日常英语提问、编写公式并运行情景分析，无需离开工作簿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e60e05245ee0eb4a",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们将 Grok 引入 Microsoft Excel。安装该加载项，即可在你已打开的工作簿中以日常英语提问、根据描述编写公式，或运行情景分析。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10745f19cbbc92ba",
      "translationZh": "开始 插入 公式 数据 审阅 视图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a85a4e77197d006",
      "translationZh": "Aptos Narrow 12 B I U 常规 % 条件格式 加载项 Grok",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13719bd7ce01bf6a",
      "translationZh": "现金销售额 2,500 3,000 3,400",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f89fdb06ee949a81",
      "translationZh": "销售退回与折让 (200) (165) (180)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45530b33d6e5c721",
      "translationZh": "应收账款回款 1,200 1,450 1,610",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13cf1fd881ca39cc",
      "translationZh": "其他收入 310 280 360",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34f9141cf3479eea",
      "translationZh": "现金收入总额 3,810 4,565 5,190",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081dec533883d9c0",
      "translationZh": "可用现金总额 12,500 13,050 13,750",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "afc7c2fe868029bf",
      "translationZh": "就你的数据提问",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "226fea5d7017159c",
      "translationZh": "选定一个区域，向 Grok 询问哪些数据发生了变化、原因是什么，以及有哪些值得关注的地方。回答会引用其依据的单元格，图表也可以直接插入工作表中，放在数据旁边。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d3add0e844fb6010",
      "translationZh": "编写公式并运行情景分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9ad31b258f0a826",
      "translationZh": "描述你想要的结果，Grok 会处理语法——求平均值、排序和填充都会以常规编辑的形式体现在公式栏中。测试不利情景、重新运行预测，或完成月末结账，都无需手动重建工作表。该加载项还可以利用连接器；你可以让它从近期电子邮件或 SharePoint 或 Google Drive 中的文件提取相关背景信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2e5b88f27dc4012",
      "translationZh": "Grok for Excel 是一款免费的 Microsoft 365 加载项。从 Microsoft Marketplace 添加它，即可直接在工作簿中使用 Grok。它也提供适用于 Word 和 PowerPoint 的版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
